00672cadded3c67","position":"1785717964574683001-2ba314fb-8a1c-4b3b-97ca-6a066cdd1dd0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785640015701203001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"94cb7133-da75-409c-99a2-d1b2dab67a7a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"67d2-bc7d-403c-43d5"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nA measured bug class: validation implemented in one CLI command while the MCP/library/reconciler paths skip it — the engine-vs-interface placement decision is made silently at plan time and never reviewed.\n\n## Approach\nAdd project criterion project.engine-layer-enforcement to the plan-review registry (via .rebar/criteria_routing.json overlay + criterion definition): ADVISORY posture; deterministic trigger = plan file_impact/scope touching src/rebar/_commands/ or interface modules while naming validation/guard/check work; the reviewer asks where the invariant is enforced and flags CLI-only placement, suggesting the engine seam. Advisory (not blocking) because placement can be legitimately interface-local; the criterion teaches, the census (skill-side) enumerates.\n\n## Scope\n- criteria registry/routing overlay + generated criteria guide regeneration\n- criterion detection detail per docs/plan-review-criteria-guide.md conventions\n\n## Testing\nBehavioral eval per LLM-surface conventions (pinned config, repeated trials): plan placing validation in CLI-only -> advisory finding fires; plan placing it in engine with CLI delegating -> no finding. Registry round-trip: rebar explain project.engine-layer-enforcement renders.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Criterion registered, routed by the deterministic trigger, ADVISORY posture, with detection detail in the generated guide.\n- [ ] Eval demonstrates fire/no-fire on the two plan shapes above.\n- [ ] rebar explain <id> serves the criterion.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/criteria","reason":"new advisory criterion"},{"path":"docs/plan-review-criteria-guide.md","reason":"generated registry"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","2f4c-7e5c-e782-4e97"],["relates_to","67d2-bc7d-403c-43d5"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2f4c-7e5c-e782-4e97","parent_status_uuid":"4fb646b0-4af8-4951-ba64-385b0a28bafa","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["gates","plan-review"],"ticket_id":"a584-3151-f2ce-415d","ticket_type":"task","title":"Engine-layer-enforcement advisory plan-review criterion (validation lives in engine, not CLI)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["86cbf56d-55d2-4e10-9e6a-d02db4bbb474","1d391c22-d46b-4eb6-bc56-a80dbf3ef3d7","5e0db6e4-b80a-4010-8777-122b7822452a","4fb646b0-4af8-4951-ba64-385b0a28bafa","2ba314fb-8a1c-4b3b-97ca-6a066cdd1dd0","94cb7133-da75-409c-99a2-d1b2dab67a7a"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785720929136210583,"uuid":"852ae262-35b4-41a4-845e-7f13cff0e025"}